[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:35. Our Village]
[00:00.860]Lesson 35. | 第35课。
[00:03.215]This is a photograph of our village. | 这是我们村庄的照片。
[00:07.290]Our village is in a valley. | 我们的村庄在一个山谷里。
[00:10.310]It is between two hills. | 它在两座山之间。
[00:13.325]The village is on a river. | 村庄在一条河边。
[00:16.985]Here is another photograph of the village. | 这是村庄的另一张照片。
[00:21.720]My wife and I are walking along the banks of the river. | 我妻子和我在河岸边散步。
[00:27.130]We are on the left. | 我们在左边。
[00:30.050]There is a boy in the water. | 水里有一个男孩。
[00:33.380]He is swimming across the river. | 他正在横渡这条河。
[00:37.110]Here is another photograph. | 这是另一张照片。
[00:41.075]This is the school building. | 这是教学楼。
[00:44.375]It is beside a park. | 它在一个公园旁边。
[00:47.200]The park is on the right. | 公园在右边。
[00:50.425]Some children are coming out of the building. | 一些孩子正从楼里出来。
[00:54.110]Some of them are going into the park. | 他们中的一些人正走进公园。